<title>USA: CBL expects to boost qtly div to $0.4425.</title>
<headline>CBL expects to boost qtly div to $0.4425.</headline>
<dateline>CHATTANOOGA, Tenn. 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>CBL &amp; Associates Properties Inc on Tuesday said it expects to increase its regular quarterly cash dividend to $0.4425 per share from $0.42 per share.</p>
<p>The change would be effective for the first quarter of 1997.</p>
</text>
